Wrap your layout with the transition. This is the only step:

  // app/layout.tsx
  import { CrayonTransition } from "@/components/crayon"

  export default function RootLayout({ children }) {
    return (
      <html lang="en">
        <body>
          <CrayonTransition>{children}</CrayonTransition>
        </body>
      </html>
    )
  }

Your existing <Link>s are intercepted automatically. Recolour with
--crayon-1, --crayon-2 and --crayon-3 in components/transitions.css.

Note: browser back/forward is not animated, and the route does not start
loading until the leave phase finishes (~1.75s).
